    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5081f9b10da50d6a7f55499d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，事情绝没有那么简单。\n在全然不习惯的环境中，是否还能像以前\n一样斩获辉煌的战绩，尚未可知――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6886a6b32af728341cf6c3f92511acfa8494ddb8d68118509cd1fb0a2a62159",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
