    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99b927479a5139c37558996",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场比赛的计划只能暂且搁置……就连日常的训练，\n恐怕也会受到极大的限制吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd59509cc35549564e5e73d24888c0114b3e9045d4119dca886ef02e37bb3c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc79c48fef93810f1d00b160",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而我自己，也无法保证能够继续以专属训练员的\n身份留在她的身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d970f8e35d54f6bf6f9dc41762b90a215c7692478aca67c88320089cdbbbc80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2353a2fdab7cb03c2dd2a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――即使如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57d1b0e2a192f8fc9462936ec1f575f2d5edf037d5e8ec94c8c6f55db06d0657",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039a655677d0b865641871f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为你……比任何事物，都要重要",
      "source_fingerprint": "e665bdad80e4e18a13905533c960cc8bb2d99f2806a10fb36661a7a5568fe97d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
