    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7f63d08053388cb2e67407",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也绝对不希望，\n红色梦想的步伐就此停滞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d16d0f81a076bff122cf3252ea903992a578c0cefe38145ae4a84297d4a98262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
