    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f06049cd3234eb369aaefce8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对此……我深受感动。\n我想，这份真心实意，\n便是治愈这副身体的最大救赎了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d2ae07978c99773237c83e87f3dffe0b29ee054bb920e1358c77f54fb9f136",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
