      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在决定要跨越海洋时……我曾追寻过，\n同样挑战过\n海外赛场的那些日本马娘们的轨迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96cc5ea405d90b03efd4a95241a34df167a1f9af1717c57b8899270e5d732f3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
