      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如红色梦想所说，她们所患上的『红之楔』，\n极其容易反复发作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ebe622511e4c0d615caba6ea2dad92966125bc7f30be7a42f7cc1d9b880876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
