    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f7cccc349c5bf4a27010364",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果在抱有如此多隐忧的状态下，\n想要在美利坚斩获华丽的战果，将是极其困难的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2f02544a159112e5873fc61c6845a541aedf7bc9173b543e1c27cc4eaab6140",
